{"id": "Ddl7NQJvAWW", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"KEY\" to get access and start generating AI videos with Higgsfield API. \n\nThis is now one of the cheapest ways to generate AI video.\n\nHiggsfield just opened access to all of their models through one API.\n\nSeedance, Kling, Nano Banana, and more, all with one key for everything.\n\nInstead of paying for a subscription, you just top up a wallet and pay per generation.\n\nNo monthly plan.\n\nNo expiring credits.\n\nAnd failed generations cost you nothing.\n\nAnd the best part?\n\nYou see the exact price of every request before you run it.\n\nSo you always know what you're spending.\n\nThink of it like a vending machine instead of a gym membership, you only pay for what you actually use.\n\nMost platforms lock their best models behind a subscription you have to commit to first.\n\nThis flips that entirely, you just load your wallet and start generating.\n\nNo fee ticking away in the background whether you use it or not.\n\n#higgsfieldai #HiggsfieldAPI #aivideos #genai #videogenerator ", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1790086662, "like_count": 2865, "comment_count": 4381, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1033274176423969a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.926, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPZgPx52jQCmE23V3avXHWfzorUzRtLMlGk7WJrunGlpjfY2IFDaXGNidSxnt0C-y3CMk66Vz7nwO4fM_0kTbgnVt_JG5yzBhndSS4.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=Adq7Kv5HMwHsiq3L079eZ1bN_QP4r9TKj3kgznmvIByHdeldzXOMo4wpjMZ2_uYLSw8&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=n9ymxSUx_ocQ7kNvwHvQPV1&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=7YwH2NYG-mHOYMQADgBt2A&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRcQO7TTWgaTZ81MJ5ZYPrj6TuKiD0NQZbmd7zG-ieUBA&oe=6AE5F545", "manifest